                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Bayard to Mr. Gresham.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >London</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1894-03-30"><hi rendition="#italic">March 30,
                        1894</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>A bill for executing award and regulations was introduced in the House of Commons
                    by attorney-general yesterday; read for the first time; second reading next
                    Monday. No opposition.</p>
            </div>
